# Later onboarding (do not skip)

After voice preview, screens **before Home**:

1. **Sign in with Apple** (no Google).
2. **Notification permission** — ask clearly, deep-link to Settings if denied. Do **not** also request Mic, Speech, AlarmKit, or ATT on this screen.
3. **Paywall** — 7-day free trial, then monthly (RevenueCat / App Store).

Just-in-time for everything else (see `docs/PERMISSIONS.md`): Microphone + Speech on first Voice Record tap; AlarmKit only if Kit schedule is used; no ATT.

Do not pretend a sound picker controls the iPhone Clock app. The alarm is the cloned voice via notifications; a chime-before-voice picker can come later, bundled in the app.
